{"authored" [{"question" "q-20061" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find $c\\cdot (b\\times a)$, if $3a\\cdot (6b\\times c)=90.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14043174/state.json" "file_sha256" "2c740817138252b31db0face977eca67daef6bbe4c4d996a8bd6d165ee9afa8a" "basis" 1617 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14043174/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-20061" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we factor out the constants and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3a\\cdot (6b\\times c) & =90 \\\\ 3\\cdot 6\\cdot [a\\cdot (b\\times c)] & =90 \\\\ a\\cdot (b\\times c) & =5.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we swap $a$ and $c$ to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}c\\cdot (b\\times a) & =-5.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14043174/state.json" "file_sha256" "2c740817138252b31db0face977eca67daef6bbe4c4d996a8bd6d165ee9afa8a" "basis" 1617 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14043174/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-20061" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14043174/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "65d3b89c237524eb311f49ccf0549c46eb1895b66967de85d0b66db5f1370d2d" "basis" 1617 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14043174/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-20061" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14043174/state.json" "file_sha256" "2c740817138252b31db0face977eca67daef6bbe4c